00:24:24.423 --> 00:24:25.433
Is Taiping the place?

00:24:44.180 --> 00:24:45.433
How are you feeling? Jenny wants you

00:24:48.715 --> 00:24:50.198
to do something (three small things).

00:24:50.380 --> 00:24:52.466
She said you have a lot of ideas and told
me to think about them (preferably now).

00:25:43.940 --> 00:25:46.640
(How confident were you about
the evening match last night?)

00:25:46.640 --> 00:25:48.000
I'm not confident (how confident

00:25:49.066 --> 00:25:51.100
were I before going into the water?)

00:25:54.000 --> 00:25:55.640
Do you know what the most difficult thing
is when you start from the water?

00:25:57.166 --> 00:25:59.786
(Standing swim) I almost drowned,
I swallowed a ton of water.

00:26:01.233 --> 00:26:02.300
(Shouldn't we go hiking?) (If
we don't go hiking soon,

00:26:02.808 --> 00:26:03.833
we'll lose followers.)

00:26:03.833 --> 00:26:05.888
Seriously, nobody watches these
videos anymore QQ (Anyway,

00:26:06.994 --> 00:26:08.278
we chatted and laughed all
the way down the mountain)

00:26:18.712 --> 00:26:20.185
(The next day,

00:26:27.669 --> 00:26:28.216
the awards ceremony) (A
slightly sunken face)

00:26:38.986 --> 00:26:40.450
(Thank you Jovi, the organizer,
for putting on such an exceptional competition.)

00:26:47.783 --> 00:26:49.256
(Still want to show off
a little) That's

00:26:51.766 --> 00:26:52.766
all for today's video!

00:26:52.766 --> 00:26:53.396
If you like my videos,

00:26:55.566 --> 00:26:56.366
welcome to Hiker CP!

00:26:57.092 --> 00:26:57.765
What happens next? (*&amp;^%^&amp;*(
See you on the mountain next time,

00:26:58.250 --> 00:26:59.927
everyone...)

00:27:00.031 --> 00:27:00.904
Extreme Ironman,

00:14:44.344 --> 00:14:45.107
log out! Coconut Water

00:18:02.633 --> 00:18:03.408
Run!! Seriously? We really

00:20:16.700 --> 00:20:18.525
have to run? I thought...

00:24:46.149 --> 00:24:47.835
Everyone can go home

00:25:51.315 --> 00:25:52.400
now :) 100% sure!

00:14:22.765 --> 00:14:23.306
(Okay) (The supply clerk is starting
to get used to it, haha)

00:14:25.542 --> 00:14:25.954
Okay (the part in the water

00:14:33.800 --> 00:14:35.272
was the most painful)

00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:14.246
My plan was to follow others
(which I myself find absurd).

00:03:31.573 --> 00:03:32.668
This is very sticky and
easily sticks crookedly.

00:04:47.867 --> 00:04:51.532
Both are Madform purple ointment; I'll use small
jars to portion them out for easier carrying.

00:05:39.643 --> 00:05:41.116
(Huh, what are we going to do??)

00:05:45.508 --> 00:05:47.418
They have no chemistry.

00:05:47.785 --> 00:05:49.933
(Forgot what he was going to
say after a pause) I'll

00:07:11.054 --> 00:07:12.070
definitely come up! (Swearing
confidently)

00:07:12.283 --> 00:07:13.301
(Will it come to this?) (Nods

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:29.871
in satisfaction &gt;///&lt;)

00:07:32.920 --> 00:07:34.366
Likes and dislikes

00:08:59.024 --> 00:08:59.780
(What a jinx!!)

00:14:04.429 --> 00:14:06.172
(The Great Demon King swims
up Sun Moon Lake)

